The Bitmask Logic:
Bit 0 (North): Set if North neighbor is different
Bit 1 (East): Set if East neighbor is different
Bit 2 (South): Set if South neighbor is different
Bit 3 (West): Set if West neighbor is different
"Bridges Cross" Mapping:

  // bridges cross mapping
  const caseToAtlasTile = {
    0: 0,   // Case 0 (all corners empty) → Atlas tile 0
